      en: ["The central mountain range of mainland Rio Muni.", "Forms a critical north-south watershed for the region.", "Characterized by hilly terrain and dense tropical rainforest.", "Home to the biodiverse Monte Alén National Park.", "Influences regional rainfall patterns and water supply.", "Acts as a natural barrier between the coast and the interior.", "Includes peaks that rise to over 1,000 meters in elevation."],
