      en: ["A dramatic gorge system where the Wele River breaks through hills.", "Located in the rugged eastern interior of Rio Muni.", "Features powerful rapids and steep, impressive river cliffs.", "A major site for observing the forces of tropical river erosion.", "Surrounded by some of the most isolated forests in the country.", "Strategically important for the region's hydrological energy.", "A key geographical landmark in the Wele-Nzas Province."],
